        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Joseph Morgan, Klaus Mikaelson\n- Works: The Vampire Diaries, The Originals\n- Concepts: Original vampires\n\nFacts:\n- Joseph Morgan was born as Joseph Martin on 16 May 1981.\n- Joseph Morgan is an English actor and director.\n- Joseph Morgan is best known for playing Klaus Mikaelson in The CW series The Vampire Diaries.\n- Joseph Morgan is also known for playing Klaus Mikaelson in The Vampire Diaries spin-off The Originals.\n- In the universes of The Vampire Diaries and The Originals, the Original vampires are a vampire family from which all current vampires descend.\n- In the universes of The Vampire Diaries and The Originals, the Original vampires are the most powerful and indestructible vampires of their kind.",
